// spec: 2, 5
// dump: ast
// `arrow` is a `line` whose `end` defaults to `arrow`: same id rules, segments and attributes,
// and an explicit `end=` wins. Its mistakes get the same help, written with `arrow`.
diagram "arrows" size (300,200)
box a "A" at (20,20) size (60,40)
box b "B" at (200,20) size (60,40)
arrow ab a.right -> b.left label="call"
arrow a.bottom -> v 40
  -> h 120 end=diamond start=dot
arrow back: b.bottom -> v 100
